{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2021-03-18 05:00:00', 'title': 'GILEAD AND NOVO NORDISK EXPAND NASH CLINICAL COLLABORATION', 'text': "FOSTER CITY, CALIF. & BAGSVÆRD, DENMARK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. (NASDAQ: GILD) AND NOVO NORDISK A/S (NASDAQ COPENHAGEN: NOVO B) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANIES HAVE EXPANDED THEIR CLINICAL COLLABORATION IN NON-ALCOHOLIC STEATOHEPATITIS (NASH). THE COMPANIES WILL CONDUCT A PHASE 2B DOUBLE-BLIND, PLACEBO-CONTROLLED STUDY TO INVESTIGATE THE SAFETY AND EFFICACY OF NOVO NORDISK'S SEMAGLUTIDE, A GLP-1 RECEPTOR AGONIST, AND A FIXED-DOSE COMBINATION OF GILEAD'S INVESTIGATIONAL FXR AG"}